# (BERLIN) the filter motion shown: on the Seq sound page the Cutoff knob's dot is where the filter is now. Timewind
# opens its Sequence from closed (its Intro): the dot far under the knob's 45 at first; with the Sequence's Width and
# Intro 0, and the Arc's Bridge and Arc 0, the dot sits on the knob
wait 300
tap ARP
wait 200
tap ARP
wait 2000
expect view 9
expect fodot <25
tap ARP
wait 200
tap ARP
wait 200
expect view 23
spin K1 -100
spin K4 -100
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 22
spin K2 -100
spin K3 -100
tap ARP
wait 200
tap ARP
wait 6000
expect view 9
expect fodot 45
